        "TileImage": "$($repository 2085da9f-6f7d-4dd1-9e82-607cda648a78).Image",
        "Description": "As big names of a worldwide drug ring, Alexander Balakrishnan and Shao Luli are expanding their shady business to the Maldives. Disguised as two receptionists, they know their powder-craving customers very well.\r\r47, they don&apos;t know your face - yet. Introduce yourself to them in this once in a lifetime chance to eliminate them both at once. To not leave any traces pointing towards the International Contract Agency, their death should undoubtedly look like an accident.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
